# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=at-spi2-core
pkgver=2.56.2
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Accessibility bus and ATK (GTK needs them)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/at-spi2-core"
license=(LGPL-2.1-or-later)
depends=(glibc glib dbus libxml2 systemd)
source=("https://download.gnome.org/sources/at-spi2-core/2.56/at-spi2-core-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('e1b1c9836a8947852f7440c32e23179234c76bd98cd9cc4001f376405f8b783b')

build() {
    meson setup at-spi2-core-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D x11=disabled -D introspection=disabled -D docs=false -D use_systemd=true
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
